    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da43283dc06703f1c7d54fbf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我知道这场比赛并不轻松！\n因为这是3200米的GⅠ长距离赛，\n也是争夺最强长途跑者宝座的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fbd5d4afeeae0bb39984dfc91b31acb1a2115c946b998d581e683e6950e454d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
