    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b648ec8fc0e61e2d615a62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是，果然身为赛马娘就会很向往\n在春天拿下那个大舞台的胜利，不是吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d37abd2bd8e14d3c1917c93e6841cc7161aa6f1e91f532774eed303fe593a61e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
